<title>BELGIUM: EU not yet received Italian EMU plan - spokesman.</title>
<headline>EU not yet received Italian EMU plan - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has not officially received Italy's updated economic convergence programme for economic and monetary union, a spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not officially received (the programme),&quot; the spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The European Union's monetary committee, a grouping of national treasury and central bank officials, meets on Wednesday to discuss Italy's efforts to bring its public finances in line with the Maastricht Treaty's criteria.</p>
<p>The issue will also be on the agenda when EU finance ministers meet in Brussels on July 7.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6838</p>
</text>
